# Agent Researcher - Implementation Plan

## Overview
Build an autonomous research agent system with 15 specialized nodes in a graph-based architecture using LangGraph, operating completely locally with Ollama for LLM processing.

---

## Project Structure

```
agent_researcher/
├── pyproject.toml              # Poetry dependencies
├── config/
│   ├── settings.yaml           # Main configuration
│   └── templates/              # Document templates
├── src/
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── orchestrator.py     # LangGraph state machine
│   │   ├── state.py            # State schema definitions
│   │   └── registry.py         # Node registry
│   ├── nodes/
│   │   ├── base.py             # Base node interface
│   │   ├── source_discovery.py
│   │   ├── web_scraper.py
│   │   ├── file_loader.py
│   │   ├── data_validator.py
│   │   ├── data_cleaning.py
│   │   ├── llm_analysis.py
│   │   ├── semantic_indexing.py
│   │   ├── content_assembly.py
│   │   ├── template_engine.py
│   │   ├── formatting.py
│   │   ├── quality_review.py
│   │   ├── metrics_collector.py
│   │   ├── improvement_analyzer.py
│   │   ├── kb_updater.py
│   │   └── logging_node.py
│   ├── storage/
│   │   ├── vector_store.py     # ChromaDB wrapper
│   │   └── metadata_db.py      # SQLite operations
│   └── monitoring/
│       ├── metrics.py          # Prometheus metrics
│       └── alerts.py           # Alert system
├── templates/                   # Jinja2 templates
├── tests/
└── docs/
```

---

## Technology Stack

| Component | Technology | Purpose |
|-----------|------------|---------|
| Orchestration | LangGraph | State machine & workflow |
| LLM | Ollama (Mistral/Qwen) | Local inference |
| Chains | LangChain | LLM pipelines |
| Vector DB | ChromaDB | Semantic storage |
| Metadata | SQLite | Structured data |
| Scraping | Scrapy + BeautifulSoup | Web extraction |
| NLP | spaCy | Text processing |
| Documents | Jinja2, WeasyPrint, python-docx | Generation |
| Monitoring | Prometheus, Loguru | Observability |

---

