### [NEW] Core Infrastructure

#### [NEW] [src/core/state.py](file:///c:/Users/Aurum/vscode/Agent%20Researcher/src/core/state.py)
TypedDict state schema with fields for query, sources, raw_data, cleaned_data, knowledge, document, metrics, errors

#### [NEW] [src/core/orchestrator.py](file:///c:/Users/Aurum/vscode/Agent%20Researcher/src/core/orchestrator.py)
LangGraph StateGraph implementation with conditional edges, error recovery, checkpointing

